# Ingenious Leonin: "{3}{W}: Put a +1/+1 counter on another target attacking creature you control. If that creature is a Cat, it gains
# first strike until end of turn." On turn 3 Bot1 attacks with its Ornithopter only: the idle Savannah Lions (a Cat that would
# match but is not attacking) and the idle Leonin itself are refused (CR 506.4, 115.1). The Ornithopter (not a Cat) is accepted and gets
# the counter (a 1/3 flyer, so Bot2 takes exactly 1) but not first strike. Sources: two Plains, a Pearl and a Jet pay {3}{W} exactly.

